  "description": "A valid Codex body for a registered conversation posted to /v1/logs, /v1/traces, / and /v1/metrics is answered 200 {} and stores nothing (those paths never parse Codex records); a Gemini-shaped logs body (prompt, api_response token counts) on /v1/logs and on /v1/logs/codex-cli stores nothing; the same Codex body on /v1/logs/codex-cli then yields its event for the first time.",
  "contract": "ADR-0016 Changes 2026-10-29 (S5c design review D0) M1 (\"Codex logs get their own path, /v1/logs/codex-cli … /v1/logs and /v1/traces stay unparsed sinks for Gemini\"); ADR-0016 Changes 2026-10-29 (S5c design) C4 Receiver allowlist (only codex.sse_event and codex.turn_cost); ADR-0016 Changes S5b R9 and §3 Receiver (sinks answer 200 {} without parsing); ADR-0011 Changes (an object without resourceMetrics is an empty request, 200 {})",
